title: Informant_Start
---
<<if !has_clue("act1_case_accepted")>>
    Renata: Flowers for the lady? No? Then I've nothing more for you, detective.
<<elseif has_clue("lead_informant_tip")>>
    Renata: I already told you what I saw. Nothing's changed since.
<<else>>
    Renata: You're the one asking after her, aren't you? The Client's fiancée.
    -> Ask what she's seen
        Renata: She walks the plaza most evenings, always the same bench. And there's a man who waits nearby — not her fiancé, I can tell you that much.
        <<add_clue "lead_informant_tip">>
        Renata: Watch them both a while. People show their true face when they think no one's looking.
    -> Ask about the man
        Renata: Keeps his distance from her in public. I'd wager that's the point.
    -> Leave
        Renata: Go on then, detective.
<<endif>>
===
